lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">这个机制</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">直到现在也还在使用</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<br>\n\n\n\n今年夏天也很火热！\n\n\n\n2016年电影最新作\n\n\n\n《波尔凯尼恩与机巧的玛机雅娜》\n\n\n\n7月16日上映！\n\n\n\n<br>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">那么</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">大家</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">请从720只宝可梦中</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">选出自己真的想要的</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">宝可梦吧！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">宝可梦电影官方网站</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">这张海报\n很厉害吧！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">地鼠，头，头（笑）</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><a class=\"gf-lineblog-source-link\" href=\"http://www.pokemon-movie.jp/election/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://www.pokemon-movie.jp/election/</a></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">ORICON STYLE</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">谁将登上720只宝可梦之巅？史上最大规模“宝可梦总选举”开始</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--